  "做一遍冻结前检查，检查过了把冻结按钮点亮，真正冻结由你来点。": "Run a pre-freeze check; once it passes, the Freeze button is enabled; you click to actually freeze.",
  "A 类基础安全标准。Agent 自动施加过压、堵转、短路前的风险评估依据。": "Type A basic safety standard. Basis for risk assessment before the Agent automatically applies overvoltage, stall, and short circuit.",
