  "Automatic Threshold on Current based Anti-pinch Mechanism for Power Windows（基于电流的电动车窗防夹机构自动阈值方法），刊于 International Journal of Electrical and Computer Engineering (IJECE)，2018": "Automatic Threshold on Current based Anti-pinch Mechanism for Power Windows (automatic threshold method for current-based anti-pinch mechanism of power windows), published in International Journal of Electrical and Computer Engineering (IJECE), 2018",
