  "B 区出现 diff 卡片与「写回并烧录」人工按钮，按钮旁标明改动行数。": "In zone B, a diff card and a manual 'Write back and flash' button appear, with the number of changed lines indicated beside the button.",
  "B 区出现缺口清单卡片，每条可点击跳到对应上传入口。": "In zone B, a gap list card appears; each item can be clicked to jump to the corresponding upload entry.",
