  "B 区模板预览内图位填上，每张图带来源角标。": "In zone B, image placeholders in the template preview are filled in; each image has a source corner mark.",
  "B 区模板预览上空格高亮，气泡给三组清单。": "In zone B, empty spaces on the template preview are highlighted, and the bubble gives three groups of lists.",
