  "CISPR 25:2021 Vehicles, boats and internal combustion engines — Radio disturbance characteristics — Limits and methods of measurement for the protection of on-board receivers，第 5.0 版，372 页（国际电工委员会国际无线电干扰特别委员会 IEC/CISPR，分技术委员会 CIS/D，2021-12-16）": "CISPR 25:2021 Vehicles, boats and internal combustion engines — Radio disturbance characteristics — Limits and methods of measurement for the protection of on-board receivers, Edition 5.0, 372 pages (International Electrotechnical Commission International Special Committee on Radio Interference IEC/CISPR, Subcommittee CIS/D, 2021-12-16)",
  "CNAS-EL-13《检测报告和校准证书相关要求的认可说明》（中国合格评定国家认可委员会 China National Accreditation Service for Conformity Assessment, CNAS，发布日期 2019-12-25）": "CNAS-EL-13 Accreditation Instructions on Requirements for Test Reports and Calibration Certificates (China National Accreditation Service for Conformity Assessment, CNAS, issue date 2019-12-25)",
  "conversion_status 是固定枚举（5 个取值），中文说明在 conversion_status_label，转化目标在 converted_into 数组（只有 parsed_into_pack 非空）。converted_into 里的 a.json#b 表示落到 a.json 的 b 字段。": "conversion_status is a fixed enum (5 values); the Chinese description is in conversion_status_label, and the conversion target is in the converted_into array (only parsed_into_pack is non-empty). a.json#b in converted_into means it lands in field b of a.json.",
  "coolingfan-openloop-debug 的「闭环目标转速」写入目标宏族之一": "The 'closed-loop target rotational speed' of coolingfan-openloop-debug is written into one of the target macro families.",
  "criterion 里只有一个布尔量，是因为「符合 5.4 条」本身是另外八条判据的合取。判定工具应把它展开成 TR-BASIC-01 至 TR-BASIC-08 的复跑，而不是让人去打勾。": "There is only one Boolean value in criterion because 'complies with Clause 5.4' is itself a conjunction of the other eight acceptance criteria. The verdict tool should expand it into reruns of TR-BASIC-01 to TR-BASIC-08, rather than having people check boxes.",
  "CSV 里有这一列，但 excel_writer.rs 不写 B 列，需人工或另行填入": "This column exists in the CSV, but excel_writer.rs does not write column B; it requires manual or separate entry.",
  "Customer.h 参数配置文件（FU6832_CONFIGURATION，202 条 #define）": "Customer.h parameter configuration file (FU6832_CONFIGURATION, 202 #define items)",
  "Customer.h 未给 ATO_BW 的范围注释；min/max 借 SPD_BW 的 [5 ~ 40] 并放宽到 100 覆盖 ATO_BW_RUN1~4 的实配值（30/53/65/65），属推定区间": "Customer.h does not provide range comments for ATO_BW; min/max borrows SPD_BW's [5 ~ 40] and is widened to 100 to cover the actual configured values of ATO_BW_RUN1~4 (30/53/65/65), which is an estimated range.",
  "Customer.h 未给范围，min/max 按 Q15 全量程推定": "Customer.h does not provide a range; min/max is estimated based on the Q15 full scale.",
  "Customer.h 未给死区范围注释，min/max 为按 MIN_WIND_TIME/PWM_MIN_WIDTH 量级推定的可调区间": "Customer.h does not provide dead zone range comments; min/max is an adjustable range estimated based on the magnitude of MIN_WIND_TIME/PWM_MIN_WIDTH.",
  "Customer.h 注释：Open-Omega 启动操作范围 500~2000；方波启动为 100~800。规程口径为「只读记录，仅切闭环失败分诊命中时才动，幅度 ±20%」": "Customer.h comments: Open-Omega startup operation range 500~2000; square wave startup is 100~800. The procedure states: 'read-only recording; adjust only when closed-loop switching failure triage is triggered, amplitude ±20%'.",
