  "FU6572 vacuum 固定 12 档顺风残速重启测试规则。用户说“测顺风”“顺风启动测试”“顺风启停”“残速重启”“惯性重启”或要求区分真顺风与静止退化时使用。只编排 vacuum-only tailwind_restart_test MCP；强制使用 GD32 CMD24/CMD7、producer-owned 虚拟示波器和 Rigol CH1 三源证据，不改固件，只测只报数，不判总 PASS/FAIL。": "FU6572 vacuum fixed 12-speed tailwind residual speed restart test rule. Used when user says 'test tailwind', 'tailwind start test', 'tailwind start-stop', 'residual speed restart', 'inertia restart', or requests to distinguish true tailwind from static degradation. Only orchestrates vacuum-only tailwind_restart_test MCP; mandatorily uses GD32 CMD24/CMD7, producer-owned virtual oscilloscope, and Rigol CH1 three-source evidence, does not modify firmware, only tests and reports data, does not judge overall PASS/FAIL.",
  "FU6572 vacuum 启停示波器回归规则。用户说“启停测试”“反复启停”“100 次启动”“带示波器启停”“startstop”或要求启动可靠性回归时使用。只编排 vacuum-only startstop_with_scope MCP；每次 observe 由工具原子执行 GD32 CMD24/CMD7、虚拟示波器和 Rigol CH1 三源取证，默认 100 次，只报逐轮事实，不提供总 PASS/FAIL。": "FU6572 vacuum start-stop oscilloscope regression rule. Used when user says 'start-stop test', 'repeated start-stop', '100 starts', 'start-stop with oscilloscope', 'startstop', or requests start reliability regression. Only orchestrates vacuum-only startstop_with_scope MCP; each observe is atomically executed by the tool with GD32 CMD24/CMD7, virtual oscilloscope, and Rigol CH1 three-source evidence collection, default 100 times, only reports per-round facts, does not provide overall PASS/FAIL.",
  "FU6572 vacuum 顺风启动接管 PI 单点调参规则。用户明确要求查看、预览、修改或恢复 DQKP_TW_Start/DQKI_TW_Start，或提到“调顺风 PI”“顺风接管 PI”“顺风失步改 PI”“还原顺风 PI”时使用。只处理当前工程沙箱 Customer.h 的两个宏；不做自动扫参或顺风 PI 动态性能判定。": "FU6572 vacuum tailwind start takeover PI single-point parameter tuning rule. Used when user explicitly requests to view, preview, modify, or restore DQKP_TW_Start/DQKI_TW_Start, or mentions 'tune tailwind PI', 'tailwind takeover PI', 'tailwind out-of-step change PI', 'restore tailwind PI'. Only handles the two macros in the current project sandbox Customer.h; does not perform automatic parameter sweep or tailwind PI dynamic performance judgment.",
  "FU6572 vacuum 运行电流环 PI 单点调参规则。用户明确要求查看、预览、修改或恢复运行电流环 DKP/DKI，或提到“调运行电流环”“调电流环 PI”“改 DKP DKI”“还原电流环 PI”时使用。只处理 Customer.h 的 DKP/DKI；QKP/QKI 仅校验别名，绝不直接修改；不做自动扫参或 PI 动态性能判定。": "FU6572 vacuum running current loop PI single-point parameter tuning rule. Used when user explicitly requests to view, preview, modify, or restore running current loop DKP/DKI, or mentions 'tune running current loop', 'tune current loop PI', 'change DKP DKI', 'restore current loop PI'. Only handles DKP/DKI in Customer.h; QKP/QKI are only for alias verification, never directly modified; does not perform automatic parameter sweep or PI dynamic performance judgment.",
  "FU6572 vacuum 运行弱磁/过调制 7 宏单点调参规则。用户明确要求查看、预览、修改或恢复 OverModulation、Weak_MagneticEn、WeakSpeed_Enter、WeakSpeed_Exit、AMIN、AKP、AKI，或明确要求通过这些参数处理高速 Uq 撞顶、弱磁进退转速、弱磁角度或弱磁 PI 时使用。只处理这 7 宏；不修改 UQ 门限、AMAX、WMUs 或控制模式，不做自动整定或稳定性判定。": "FU6572 vacuum running field weakening/overmodulation 7-macro single-point parameter tuning rule. Used when user explicitly requests to view, preview, modify, or restore OverModulation, Weak_MagneticEn, WeakSpeed_Enter, WeakSpeed_Exit, AMIN, AKP, AKI, or explicitly requests to handle high-speed Uq hitting the ceiling, field weakening entry/exit rotational speed, field weakening angle, or field weakening PI through these parameters. Only handles these 7 macros; does not modify UQ threshold, AMAX, WMUs, or control mode, does not perform automatic tuning or stability judgment.",
  "FU6572 vacuum 运行态载波/死区单点调参规则。用户明确要求查看、预览、修改或恢复运行载波、内部 PWM 频率、PWM_FREQUENCY、运行死区或 PWM_DEADTIME 时使用。只处理 Customer.h 的 PWM_FREQUENCY/PWM_DEADTIME；Pole_Pairs 仅用于理论转速提示；不处理 PWM 输入端口、不做自动扫参或稳定性判定。": "FU6572 vacuum running-state carrier/deadtime single-point parameter tuning rule. Used when user explicitly requests to view, preview, modify, or restore running carrier, internal PWM frequency, PWM_FREQUENCY, running deadtime, or PWM_DEADTIME. Only handles PWM_FREQUENCY/PWM_DEADTIME in Customer.h; Pole_Pairs is only used for theoretical rotational speed hint; does not handle PWM input port, does not perform automatic parameter sweep or stability judgment.",
  "FU6572 vacuum 运行外环 PI 单点调参规则。用户明确要求查看、预览、修改或恢复外环 SKP/SKI/LOOP_TIME，或提到“调外环 PI”“调功率环”“调速度环”“改 SKP SKI”“调外环周期”“还原外环 PI”时使用。只处理 Customer.h 的 SKP/SKI/LOOP_TIME；不做自动扫参、hunting 或稳定性判定。": "FU6572 vacuum running outer loop PI single-point parameter tuning rule. Used when user explicitly requests to view, preview, modify, or restore outer loop SKP/SKI/LOOP_TIME, or mentions 'tune outer loop PI', 'tune power loop', 'tune speed loop', 'change SKP SKI', 'tune outer loop period', 'restore outer loop PI'. Only handles SKP/SKI/LOOP_TIME in Customer.h; does not perform automatic parameter sweep, hunting, or stability judgment.",
  "FU6832 散热风扇驱动板（峰岹 AI_散热风扇开发资料 CoolingFan_Program 工程）": "FU6832 Cooling fan driver board (Fortior AI_Cooling fan development materials CoolingFan_Program Project)",
