  "GB/T 10125-2021《人造气氛腐蚀试验 盐雾试验》（国家标准化管理委员会，2021-08-20 发布 / 2022-03-01 实施，现行，全部代替 GB/T 10125-2012）": "GB/T 10125-2021 Corrosion tests in artificial atmospheres — Salt spray tests (Standardization Administration of China, issued on 2021-08-20 / implemented on 2022-03-01, current, fully replaces GB/T 10125-2012)",
  "GB/T 15706-2012《机械安全 设计通则 风险评估与风险减小》（国家标准化管理委员会，2012，现行，以翻译法等同采用 ISO 12100:2010）": "GB/T 15706-2012 Safety of machinery — General principles for design — Risk assessment and risk reduction (Standardization Administration of China, 2012, current, identically adopted by translation method as ISO 12100:2010)",
  "GB/T 18655-2025《车辆、船和内燃机 无线电骚扰特性 用于保护车载接收机的限值和测量方法》（全国无线电干扰标准化技术委员会，2025-02-28 发布并实施，现行，代替 GB/T 18655-2018）": "GB/T 18655-2025 Vehicles, boats and internal combustion engines — Radio disturbance characteristics — Limits and methods of measurement for the protection of on-board receivers (National Radio Interference Standardization Technical Committee, issued and implemented on 2025-02-28, current, replaces GB/T 18655-2018)",
  "GB/T 21437 系列《道路车辆 电气/电子部件对传导和耦合引起的电骚扰试验方法》第 1 至 3 部分（均为 2021 版）；第 4 部分为 GB/Z 21437.4-2025（全国汽车标准化技术委员会电子电磁兼容分技术委员会）": "GB/T 21437 series Road vehicles — Electrical/electronic components — Test methods for electrical disturbances from conduction and coupling, Parts 1 to 3 (all 2021 editions); Part 4 is GB/Z 21437.4-2025 (National Automotive Standardization Technical Committee, Electromagnetic Compatibility Subcommittee)",
  "GB/T 21437.2 的国际对应。": "International counterpart of GB/T 21437.2.",
