  "gym-electric-motor（GEM），电机控制强化学习仿真环境（德国帕德博恩大学电驱动系统教研室 Universität Paderborn, Lehrstuhl für Elektrische Antriebssysteme, LEA）": "gym-electric-motor (GEM), motor control reinforcement learning simulation environment (University of Paderborn, Germany, Chair of Electrical Drive Systems, Universität Paderborn, Lehrstuhl für Elektrische Antriebssysteme, LEA)",
  "HEADWIND_IQ_BRAKE_ENABLED = 1 时不得高于 IQ_BRAKE_START_SPEED": "When HEADWIND_IQ_BRAKE_ENABLED = 1, must not exceed IQ_BRAKE_START_SPEED",
  "hot_boundary_c = 30 ℃ 这个分界是本包为了让表达式可求值而设的：标准给的是 −40 ℃ / 常温 / 80 ℃ 三个离散点，不是连续区间。实际执行时应按试验项显式选档，而不是靠温度回读去猜。": "hot_boundary_c = 30 ℃ This boundary is set by this package to make expressions evaluable: the standard provides three discrete points, −40 ℃ / room temperature / 80 ℃, not a continuous interval. During actual execution, the range should be explicitly selected according to the test item, rather than guessed from temperature readback.",
  "How to Reduce Motor Noise with Code-Free, Sensorless FOC（用免代码无感磁场定向控制降低电机噪声；德州仪器，文献号 SLLA567）": "How to Reduce Motor Noise with Code-Free, Sensorless FOC (using code-free sensorless field-oriented control to reduce motor noise; Texas Instruments, document number SLLA567)",
