  "IS_Pulses、IS_Duty、IS_IqInit（由 MCEWizard 自动计算）；初始角检测按六个角度注入电流脉冲；过压/欠压保护、过流检测、堵转防护。注意这是无刷方案的参数体系，有刷直流用不上初始角检测那一段。": "IS_Pulses, IS_Duty, IS_IqInit (automatically calculated by MCEWizard); initial angle detection injects current pulses at six angles; overvoltage/undervoltage protection, overcurrent detection, stall protection. Note: this is the parameter system for brushless solutions; brushed DC does not need the initial angle detection part.",
  "ISO/IEC 17025:2017 General requirements for the competence of testing and calibration laboratories（检测和校准实验室能力的通用要求），第 3 版（ISO 与 IEC 联合，2017）": "ISO/IEC 17025:2017 General requirements for the competence of testing and calibration laboratories, 3rd edition (jointly by ISO and IEC, 2017)",
  "ITSC — 三相感应电机匝间短路故障电流数据集（含读取脚本；GitHub 账号 ibarram；被测件 Baldor CM3542，0.75 hp）": "ITSC — Three-phase induction motor inter-turn short-circuit fault current dataset (includes read script; GitHub account ibarram; DUT Baldor CM3542, 0.75 hp)",
  "latency_margin_ms 这个 100 ms 裕量是本包编的，任何标准都没有规定「检出延迟」这个量——法规只管力峰值。把它列成独立判据是为了让调参闭环有一个可优化的中间指标。": "latency_margin_ms: This 100 ms margin is fabricated in this package; no standard defines 'detection latency'—regulations only govern force peak. Listing it as an independent acceptance criterion is to provide an optimizable intermediate metric for the parameter tuning closed loop.",
  "LV 124、VW 80000、LV 148、BMW GS 95024 的本地副本都是公网流传的非授权版本": "Local copies of LV 124, VW 80000, LV 148, and BMW GS 95024 are all unauthorized versions circulating on the public internet.",
  "LV 測試波型": "LV test waveform",
  "Max 電流 (mA)": "Max Current (mA)",
  "MBN LV 148: 2013-11 — Electric and Electronic Components in Motor Vehicles: 48 V On-Board Electrical System, Requirements and Test Conditions（戴姆勒 Daimler AG 采标版，基础版 LV 148 Edition 2013-07）": "MBN LV 148: 2013-11 — Electric and Electronic Components in Motor Vehicles: 48 V On-Board Electrical System, Requirements and Test Conditions (Daimler AG adopted version, Basic version LV 148 Edition 2013-07)",
  "MCAF 默认 45°，实测后推荐 8° 至 20°，低于 5° 不建议，本包取 14°。调小则 Kp 变大、Ki 变小，短期响应改善。已核实。": "MCAF default is 45°; after measured data, recommended 8° to 20°; below 5° not recommended; this package uses 14°. If reduced, Kp increases and Ki decreases, improving short-term response. Verified.",
  "MCAF 默认 80°，实测后推荐 50° 至 70°，本包取中值 60°。调小则 Kp 与 Ki 同时变大，响应更快但超调风险升高；调大则增益下降、稳定性提高、带宽降低。已核实。": "MCAF default is 80°; after measured data, recommended 50° to 70°; this package uses the median 60°. If reduced, both Kp and Ki increase, response is faster but overshoot risk increases; if increased, gain decreases, stability improves, and bandwidth decreases. Verified.",
  "MCAF 文档明确：若正常启动时序跑不通或无法正确切入闭环换相，电流环整定需在开环换相下进行。这条直接规定了「先整定电流环、再调开闭环切换」。已核实。": "MCAF document specifies: if the normal startup sequence fails or cannot correctly enter closed-loop commutation, current loop tuning must be performed under open-loop commutation. This directly specifies 'tune the current loop first, then adjust open-loop/closed-loop transition'. Verified.",
  "mcState 一直停在开环态，转速上不到目标": "mcState stays in open-loop state; rotational speed cannot reach target.",
