  "min/max 取自 Customer.h「PWM 寬頻支援: 10hz ~ 90khz」注释中的 kHz 量级上下限": "min/max are taken from the kHz order upper and lower limits in the comment 'PWM wide frequency support: 10hz ~ 90khz' in Customer.h",
  "Motor Control Application Framework (MCAF) 文档 5.1.6 节 Current loop tuning（电流环整定；微芯科技 Microchip Technology Inc.，MCAF R7 RC37 文档，版本 7.0.2）": "Motor Control Application Framework (MCAF) Document Section 5.1.6 Current loop tuning (current loop tuning; Microchip Technology Inc., MCAF R7 RC37 document, version 7.0.2)",
