  "tags.parameters 的两个宏里只有 SPEED_MODE 能解析到本包的 control-parameters.json（key = speed_mode）。OPENLOOP_ENABLED 宏在本工程 Customer.h:220 确实存在（当前值 0，开环调速禁用），但它不在本包登记的 70 个控制参数里——本包登记的 outloop_enabled 对应的是 OUTLOOP_ENABLED（速度外环使能），与 OPENLOOP_ENABLED（开环调速使能）是两个宏，名字只差一个字母，不可混用。前端按参数检索时 OPENLOOP_ENABLED 这一维检索不到，需先补登记该宏": "Among the two macros in tags.parameters, only SPEED_MODE can be parsed to this package's control-parameters.json (key = speed_mode). The OPENLOOP_ENABLED macro does exist in this project's Customer.h:220 (current value 0, open-loop speed control disabled), but it is not among the 70 control parameters registered in this package—the outloop_enabled registered in this package corresponds to OUTLOOP_ENABLED (speed outer loop enable), which is a different macro from OPENLOOP_ENABLED (open-loop speed control enable), differing by only one letter, and must not be confused. When the frontend searches by parameter, the OPENLOOP_ENABLED dimension cannot be found; this macro must be registered first.",
  "TIDA-01389 用两颗 DRV5013-Q1 锁存霍尔构成位置编码（带宽 30 kHz）；无霍尔方案走电流纹波计数。": "TIDA-01389 uses two DRV5013-Q1 latching Hall sensors to form position encoding (bandwidth 30 kHz); the Hall-less solution uses current ripple counting.",
  "TLE9855QX Window Lift Reference Design Guide，v01_01（英飞凌科技 Infineon Technologies AG，经贸泽电子 Mouser Electronics 镜像发布）": "TLE9855QX Window Lift Reference Design Guide, v01_01 (Infineon Technologies AG, mirror release by Mouser Electronics)",
  "UM3259 — STM32 motor control SDK: 6-step firmware sensorless parameter optimization（意法半导体 STMicroelectronics N.V.）": "UM3259 — STM32 motor control SDK: 6-step firmware sensorless parameter optimization (STMicroelectronics N.V.)",
  "UN ECE R21 — Uniform Provisions Concerning the Approval of Vehicles with Regard to Their Interior Fittings（联合国欧洲经济委员会第 21 号法规：车辆内饰认证统一规定；联合国欧洲经济委员会 UNECE），第 5.8 条系列": "UN ECE R21 — Uniform Provisions Concerning the Approval of Vehicles with Regard to Their Interior Fittings (United Nations Economic Commission for Europe Regulation No. 21: Uniform provisions concerning the approval of vehicles with regard to their interior fittings; United Nations Economic Commission for Europe UNECE), Article 5.8 series",
  "v0.1 原样跑，97 条可用样本判出 94 条 FAULT、3 条 UNCERTAIN、0 条 OK，对金标准检出率 96.9%；v0.2 只判出 39 条 FAULT，作为成因判据是倒退": "v0.1 run as is: 97 available samples yielded 94 FAULT, 3 UNCERTAIN, 0 OK, with 96.9% detection rate against the gold standard; v0.2 only yielded 39 FAULT, which is a regression as cause acceptance criteria.",
  "v0.2 那条 start_env_decay_ratio 判别的是「这次启动成没成」，不是「为什么不行」——把结果当成因去标定，判据就退化了": "The start_env_decay_ratio in v0.2 discriminates 'whether this startup succeeded', not 'why it failed'—using the result as cause for calibration degrades the acceptance criteria.",
  "vacuum 板级三相输出验证规则。用户要求“验板”“板级验证”“IPMTest 三相验证”“CH2/CH3/CH4 三相输出取证”时使用。只编排 vacuum-only board_verify MCP 与现有 keil-c51-tuning 构建烧录链；工具原子拥有 GD32 PG0、虚拟示波器 ADC2_DR 和 Rigol 三相取证，固定 ±10% 判据，任何退出路径都必须完成 safe-off、源码恢复和 baseline 固件恢复。": "vacuum board-level three-phase output verification rule. Used when the user requests 'board verification', 'board-level verification', 'IPMTest three-phase verification', or 'CH2/CH3/CH4 three-phase output evidence'. Only orchestrates the vacuum-only board_verify MCP and the existing keil-c51-tuning build and flash chain; the tool atoms own GD32 PG0, virtual oscilloscope ADC2_DR, and Rigol three-phase evidence, with fixed ±10% acceptance criteria. Any exit path must complete safe-off, source code recovery, and baseline firmware recovery.",
  "vacuum 相电流采样链路验证规则。用户要求“验采样”“验电流采样”“采样链路验证”“采样准不准”“验放大倍数”时使用。只编排 vacuum-only sample_verify MCP 与现有 keil-c51-tuning 构建烧录链；工具临时固定开环验证宏，原子拥有 GD32 PG0、虚拟示波器 fault 与 Rigol CH1 overview/zoom 证据，按 PKPK/2 电流区间和 ±20% 转速双判据验证，任何退出路径都必须完成 safe-off、源码恢复和 baseline 固件恢复。": "vacuum phase current sampling chain verification rule. Used when the user requests 'verify sampling', 'verify current sampling', 'sampling chain verification', 'sampling accuracy', or 'verify amplification factor'. Only orchestrates the vacuum-only sample_verify MCP and the existing keil-c51-tuning build and flash chain; the tool temporarily fixes the open-loop verification macro, and the atoms own GD32 PG0, virtual oscilloscope fault, and Rigol CH1 overview/zoom evidence, verifying by PKPK/2 current interval and ±20% rotational speed dual acceptance criteria. Any exit path must complete safe-off, source code recovery, and baseline firmware recovery.",
